# PLT hooking (lsplt, inside the Zygisk loader) writes to copied anonymous pages, which needs execmem
# in the injected app domain on some ZygiskNext builds. Granting it to zygote covers the injection path.
# The profile file itself is read by the ROOT companion (magisk daemon domain, which can already read
# shell_data_file), so no app-domain file rule is needed — that is the whole point of the companion.
allow zygote self execmem
